<title>JAPAN: Nippon Television shares climb in morning.</title>
<headline>Nippon Television shares climb in morning.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Nippon Television Network Corp rose on Wednesday morning, as the popularity of newly listed Nippon Broadcasting System Inc spilled over to other issues in the broadcasting industry, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0059 GMT, the share price was up 1,500 yen to 34,900 yen, in a volume of 9,170 shares.</p>
